<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers sold steady. Trading active. Slaughter heifers not enough to establish a market. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - High Select and Choice 2-3, 1200-1350 lbs 67.50-68.50. Select and Choice 2-3, 1100-1300 lbs 66.50-67.50. Select 1-2, 64.50-66.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - High Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1250 lbs scarce. Select and Choice 2-3, 950-1100 lbs 65.00-67.50. Select 1-2, 64.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
